stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> Incomplete: inspection failed
    Observe --> Pending: created or missing
    Observe --> Corroborate: running or exited
    Pending --> Observe: budget remains
    Pending --> Incomplete: budget exhausted
    Corroborate --> Observe: changed IDs, budget remains
    Corroborate --> Incomplete: changed IDs, budget exhausted
    Corroborate --> Complete: same IDs, running or recognized exit 0
    Corroborate --> Incomplete: same IDs, failed state
    note right of Observe
        Each read has a 15 s limit.
        Always allow the initial pair.
    end note
    Complete --> [*]
    Incomplete --> [*]
